:325046,"en":"Your kindness will become his strength,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b002:l038","ordinal":325047,"en":"And bring disaster on your head!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b002:l039","ordinal":325048,"en":"His temper will sour and he will bare his teeth,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b002:l040","ordinal":325049,"en":"He will turn on you in wrath,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b003:l001","ordinal":325050,"en":"His fury will exceed all bounds;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b003:l002","ordinal":325051,"en":"When this wretch reaches full rage,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b003:l003","ordinal":325052,"en":"He will seize you by the throat."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b003:l004","ordinal":325053,"en":"He will study your bearing,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b003:l005","ordinal":325054,"en":"Then, inflamed, provoke your anger;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b003:l006","ordinal":325055,"en":"He will confront you openly,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b003:l007","ordinal":325056,"en":"And your misery will drive you mad."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b003:l008","ordinal":325057,"en":"He will take your people from you,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b003:l009","ordinal":325058,"en":"And cast your affairs into ruin."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b003:l010","ordinal":325059,"en":"He will smash your mouth,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b003:l011","ordinal":325060,"en":"And knock your teeth clean out."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b003:l012","ordinal":325061,"en":"He will make sport of your people,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b003:l013","ordinal":325062,"en":"And bend your back time after time."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b003:l014","ordinal":325063,"en":"He will not heed a word you say,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b003:l015","ordinal":325064,"en":"But strike your eyes from their sockets;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b003:l016","ordinal":325065,"en":"If opposed, he will bind your giant,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b003:l017","ordinal":325066,"en":"And seize your mares as spoil."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b003:l018","ordinal":325067,"en":"If you begin to wheedle him, saying,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b003:l019","ordinal":325068,"en":"“My own blood brother has become lord,”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b003:l020","ordinal":325069,"en":"He will punch your brains out."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b003:l021","ordinal":325070,"en":"Thus he will truly destroy"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b003:l022","ordinal":325071,"en":"Whatever wits you have."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b003:l023","ordinal":325072,"en":"When that madman surges forth,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b003:l024","ordinal":325073,"en":"Will he not bring hell upon your host?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b003:l025","ordinal":325074,"en":"Will he not take revenge without stopping?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b003:l026","ordinal":325075,"en":"Will he not overturn my mountain"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b003:l027","ordinal":325076,"en":"And raise a riotous uproar?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b003:l028","ordinal":325077,"en":"Will he not rain down volleys of arrows?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b003:l029","ordinal":325078,"en":"Will he not seize and occupy the White Palace?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b003:l030","ordinal":325079,"en":"He will break the strength you girded,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b003:l031","ordinal":325080,"en":"And utterly crush your people."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b003:l032","ordinal":325081,"en":"If you are a lion, if you are a tiger,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b003:l033","ordinal":325082,"en":"If you are truly my wedded lord,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b003:l034","ordinal":325083,"en":"Hear my words, my khan:"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b003:l035","ordinal":325084,"en":"In the end Külchoro will gouge out your eyes!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b003:l036","ordinal":325085,"en":"Hero Seytek will pursue you;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b003:l037","ordinal":325086,"en":"If Kanykey and Aichürök still live,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b003:l038","ordinal":325087,"en":"They will bring your sickness to a head."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b003:l039","ordinal":325088,"en":"If your upstart mounts the golden throne,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0385:b003:l040","ordinal":325089,"en":"Bakai will split your crown."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0386:b002:l001","ordinal":325090,"en":"Tell the warriors—tell your men!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0386:b002:l002","ordinal":325091,"en":"Tell the executioner who, when the khan commands,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0386:b002:l003","ordinal":325092,"en":"Takes human noses and ears"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0386:b002:l004","ordinal":325093,"en":"And wears them as amulets;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0386:b002:l005","ordinal":325094,"en":"Who drinks and is never sated with blood,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0386:b002:l006","ordinal":325095,"en":"Who grapples and never spares a life,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0386:b002:l007","ordinal":325096,"en":"Who drinks poison when told to drink water,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0386:b002:l008","ordinal":325097,"en":"And scoops blood when told to scoop souls;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0386:b002:l009","ordinal":325098,"en":"Bull-necked and camel-thighed,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0386:b002:l010","ordinal":325099,"en":"Who wrings the life from those he grapples—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0386:b002:l011","ordinal":325100,"en":"Tell that savage wrestler and headsman,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0386:b002:l012","ordinal":325101,"en":"Tell him who stands beneath the banner!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0386:b002:l013","ordinal":325102,"en":"Tell him who, when word comes from the khan,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0386:b002:l014","ordinal":325103,"en":"Levels his spear without delay;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0386:b002:l015","ordinal":325104,"en":"Tell the marksman who never misses,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0386:b002:l016","ordinal":325105,"en":"Who destroys whoever attacks"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0386:b002:l017","ordinal":325106,"en":"And delivers punishment with his own hand."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0386:b002:l018","ordinal":325107,"en":"Give the order in your wrath;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0386:b002:l019","ordinal":325108,"en":"Upon the head of the maddened slave"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0386:b002:l020","ordinal":325109,"en":"Bring utter and final destruction!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0386:b002:l021","ordinal":325110,"en":"When the wrestlers close in,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0386:b002:l022","ordinal":325111,"en":"Let his head fly off with a crack;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0386:b002:l023","ordinal":325112,"en":"From this vagrant rebel"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0386:b002:l024","ordinal":325113,"en":"Let life depart with a shriek."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0386:b002:l025","ordinal":325114,"en":"Let them fit their spearheads,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0386:b002:l026","ordinal":325115,"en":"And begin the combat in full;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0386:b002:l027","ordinal":325116,"en":"Destroy this monstrous villain"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0386:b002:l028","ordinal":325117,"en":"And grind him beneath the earth!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0386:b002:l029","ordinal":325118,"en":"You bluster without cause,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0386:b002:l030","ordinal":325119,"en":"Bull-chested and rash-tempered—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0386:b002:l031","ordinal":325120,"en":"Can a hero be like you?"}]
